11
01:05:18,750 --> 01:05:24,750
RocketMan (also written as Rocket Man) is a 1997 American comic science fiction film produced by Walt
Disney Pictures and Caravan Pictures, and distributed by Buena Vista Pictures Distribution.

12
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:21,000
Directed by Stuart Gillard, it stars Harland Williams,
Jessica Lundy, William Sadler, and Jeffrey DeMunn.

13
